{
  "backupId": {{fixedTimestamp}}
}

###

GET {{ORCHESTRATION_CLUSTER_MANAGEMENT_API}}/actuator/backupRuntime/{{fixedTimestamp}}

###

POST {{ORCHESTRATION_CLUSTER_MANAGEMENT_API}}/actuator/exporting/resume
Content-Type: application/json

